            "review_title": "Review at Com Nieu Thien Ly",
            "review_text": "実佳 山\n2 contributions\n0\nOh, my God.\nMar 2025 • Family\nViet Nam such as Pho and Banh Seo! You can eat Vietnamese-style seasoned dishes that the locals eat for lunch, not Vietnamese dishes like that. Chingen soups and empty vegetables are very tasty with gentle flavors. The fluffy aroma of jasmine makes white rice more chopsticky. Many locals come here to enjoy the festival.\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten March 31, 2025",
